{"availability":"available","full":"justinluther502/cashgraphfront","name":"cashgraphfront","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Vue","stars":8,"forks":2,"created":"2022-03-31T21:43:16Z","updated":"2023-06-03T15:00:59Z","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://www.cashgraphs.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:31:12.390Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:31:12.390Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:31:12.390Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.698Z","stars":8,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:45:01.352Z","stars":8,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:13:13.934Z","stars":8,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:31:12.390Z","stars":8,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["CashGraphs is a fintech web app for running modern portfolio theory optimizations. Select a \"flavor\" to specify your investable asset universe, a risk metric, and any weight constraints, and then run the optimizer. The algorithm will pick out a full efficient frontier of optimized portfolios for all risk preferences.","I'm a personal financial adviser, and I like getting into the weeds on asset allocation stuff. I also like learning coding stuff and thought that portfolio optimization was a cool use case for machine learning optimizers like TensorFlow and Torch (the first few versions of the backend used TensorFlow). I use this optimizer for my client portfolios, and I thought that larger-scale portfolio managers might be interested in it as well."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/justinluther502/cashgraphfront/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"878f589a4ac9ebef9ba2f9867dfaf2fa36f2acfd7a2ee1bb43cd7536775cd376","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:19.105Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:17.013Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"CashGraphs is a fintech web app for running modern portfolio theory optimizations. Select a \"f